Z||000018||ITB 2M4||11-27-2001||12:21 AM||||For $69 U.S., you can get a Dreamcast with NFL 2K1, MBL 2K1, and NBA 2K1 at Circuit City (may have been Best Buy).<P>Le Mans 24hr for the DreamCast is probably the best RACING game for ANY console out there (havn't played NASCAR Heat or NASCAR 2002 for PS2 yet).  GT-3 is a great driving game, but not racing.  The ball games have great graphics, and in the case of NFL 2K2, the AI makes adjustments as the game goes on, so you can't run the same plays all the time.  Just no commitment like there is for the Playstation.  I thought this might happen to them, after what happened with my Sega Saturn.  But I'm glad I bought the DC.<P>------------------<BR>SCCA ITB '84 Fiero 2M4||||reg||1
